# Bear Rive Animation Placeholder
# 
# This is a placeholder file. Replace with actual bear.riv animation file.
# 
# Required State Machine: "State Machine 1"
# Required Inputs:
# - emotion (String): "happy", "sad", "angry", "surprised", "scared", "disgusted", "idle"
# - intensity (Number): 0.0 - 1.0
# - activity (String): "play", "meditate", "comfort", "exercise", "sleep"
#
# Animation States:
# - Idle: Default calm bear state
# - Happy: Joyful bear with bouncing movements
# - Sad: Melancholy bear with drooped posture
# - Angry: Frustrated bear with aggressive stance
# - Surprised: Startled bear with wide eyes
# - Scared: Fearful bear with protective posture
# - Disgusted: Uncomfortable bear expression
# - Playing: Playful bear movements
# - Meditating: Calm, breathing bear animation
# - Comforting: Gentle, nurturing bear movements
#
# Download from: https://rive.app/community/files/
# Or create custom animation in Rive Editor: https://rive.app/
